       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PROGBAT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MAST-FILE ASSIGN TO MASTDD
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               RECORD KEY IS MAST-KEY.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MAST-FILE.
       01  MAST-REC.
           05  MAST-KEY        PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN I-O MAST-FILE.
           READ MAST-FILE.
           REWRITE MAST-REC.
           CLOSE MAST-FILE.
           GOBACK.
